      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðone ðe oþres mannes man underfehþ butan leafe.] [Ld] Ne underfó nan man oðres mannes man butan þæs leafe ðe he ær fyligde ⁊ ær he sy laðleas wið ælce hand. Gif hit hwa dó, bete mine oferhyrnesse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">No man shall take into his services one who has been in the service of another without the permission of the latter, and until he is free of all charges from any other quarter. If any man does so, he shall pay as compensation the amount due for insubordination to me.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne underfo nan man oðres mannes man butan ðæs leafe ðe he ær fylgde, ⁊ ær he sy laðleas wið ælce hand. Gyf hit hwa dó, bete mine oferhyrnesse.</ab>
      </div>
